sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Flask App as App
    participant File System as FS
    participant OpenCV as OCV

    User->>Browser: Select file, click Upload
    Browser->>App: POST / (multipart/form-data)
    App->>App: Validate file present & non-empty
    App->>App: Sanitize name (secure_filename) + gen UUID
    App->>FS: Save original image to uploads/s
    App->>OCV: imread original
    OCV-->>App: Image matrix or None
    App->>App: If None -> error message
    App->>OCV: cvtColor to grayscale
    App->>FS: write grayscale image to uploads/
    App-->>Browser: 200 HTML (includes preview URL + download URL)

    Browser->>App: GET /uploads/<f>
// preview
    App->>FS: read file
    App-->>Browser: 200 image/<>content-type>

    Browser->>App: GET /download/<f>
    App->>FS: read file
    App-->>Browser: 200 attachment
